{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42408","headline":"和徐鼎臣见寄 · 包頴","name":"和徐鼎臣见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生中表最情亲，浮世那堪聚散频。\n谢朓去吟归省阁，刘桢犹自卧漳滨。\n旧游半似前生事，要路多逢後进人。\n且喜新吟报强健，明年相望杏园春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包頴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}